<section class="sx-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="sx-wrap sx-hero-grid">
    <div class="sx-hero-copy">
      <p class="sx-kicker"><i class="sx-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i> Hi, I'm Eric. Open to junior product design roles</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Product Designer: systems, flows, prototypes.</h1>
      <p class="sx-lede">I design token-based Figma systems and clickable prototypes that engineers can build from. Texas-based, open to work.</p>
      <ul class="sx-badges" aria-label="At a glance">
        <li>Texas (Open to Remote &amp; Relocation)</li><li>2 Concurrent Design Internships (Flyrank AI &amp; Stealth Startup)</li><li>Design Systems &amp; Token Architecture</li><li>B.S. User Experience Design, Western Governors University</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="sx-cta"><a class="sx-btn" href="mailto:ericforall247@gmail.com"><svg class="sx-btn-icon" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.85" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg><span>Email</span></a><a class="sx-btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/eric-ariel-de-la-paz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="sx-btn-icon" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.85" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect width="4" height="12" x="2" y="9"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg><span>LinkedIn</span></a><a class="sx-btn" href="assets/Eric_De_La_Paz_Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="sx-btn-icon" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.85" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="13" y2="13"/><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="17" y2="17"/><line x1="10" x2="8" y1="9" y2="9"/></svg><span>Resume</span></a><a class="sx-btn sx-btn-primary" href="#work"><svg class="sx-btn-icon" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.85" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><polyline points="19 12 12 19 5 12"/></svg><span>View my work</span></a></div>
